        "body": "This release again contains a _multitude of important bug fixes_, especially in finding kinetic values in BRENDA and SABIO-RK, and also the following new enhacements:\r\n* LP, NLP, variability and evolutionary analysis building and parallelized communication now run with a better performance (i.e. the Python code overhead was reduced)\r\n* Spreadsheets now print more numeric values as floats and not as strings\r\n* Reactions with a negative upper bound are now loaded correctly thanks to @PyLaRi24\r\n* The oftentimes annoying signal handling of stopping running instances (which hides where the code was running) was removed\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* Version 0.0.13 by @Paulocracy in https://github.com/klamt-lab/COBRA-k/pull/18\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/klamt-lab/COBRA-k/compare/v0.0.12...v0.0.13",
